From: fryezero <108418382+fryezero@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 14:35:24 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] mu: GFx Selection, Mouse and System.capabilities
 extensions

Selection.disableFocusKeys (no Tab/arrow focus moves), disableFocusAutoRelease
(clicking outside keeps the focus), disableFocusRolloverEvent and
alwaysEnableArrowKeys (stored), numFocusGroups, getFocusBitmask,
getControllerMaskByFocusGroup, get/setControllerFocusGroup, findFocus/
moveFocus (no candidate) and captureFocus; Mouse.setCursorType,
getTopMostEntity, getButtonsState, getPosition and the cursor/button
constants; System.capabilities.numControllers = 1, which CLIK's focus code
loops over (without it no CLIK TextInput takes the focus).  Mouse picking at
an arbitrary stage point (run_mouse_pick_at) checks topmostLevel clips
first.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
